      "subject_newsroom_count": 6,
      "summary": "A painting by Vincent van Gogh was sold at auction for a record price of $190.4 million (reported as £145 million in some outlets). The sale, handled by Sotheby’s, attracted attention because the work’s provenance includes a disputed chapter tied to Nazi-era ownership; despite controversy, bidders drove the final price to a new high for the artist."
